WEBVTT

00:07:59.683 --> 00:08:01.936
growing up like my dad,

00:08:01.977 --> 00:08:05.606
aren't searching for food
by whatever means possible.

00:08:06.398 --> 00:08:10.861
Then, then we will see

00:08:10.903 --> 00:08:13.614
the true potential of every kid.

00:08:13.656 --> 00:08:18.702
And that's the calling of this moment
to redesign our systems

00:08:18.744 --> 00:08:22.456
to see people, all people.

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.500
Thank you.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:29.129
(Applause and cheers)